        "params": {
          "text": "DELAY SYNC TEST\n\nTempo-synced delay with step sequencer melody.\n\n- Clock (120 BPM) -> Step Sequencer (8-step melody)\n- Sequencer CV/Gate -> VCO + ADSR -> VCA -> Delay -> Output\n\nDelay settings:\n- Tempo Sync: ON (locked to clock)\n- Sync Rate: 1/8 note (index 3)\n- Feedback: 0.4 (nice repeats)\n- Ping-Pong: ON (stereo bouncing)\n- Tone: 0.6 (warm repeats)\n\nMelody: C E G C' G Eb F G#\n(pitch values are semitones from C4)\n\nTry:\n- syncRate 2 (1/4) = half-time echoes\n- syncRate 4 (1/16) = rapid flutters\n- Increase feedback for dub-style trails"
        }
      }
